[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "text": "Damn, is it my turn yet? "
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "text": "Uhh,"
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "text": "anybody work here"
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "text": "This is taking forever!"
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "text": "Open the gate "
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "text": "so I can kick some ass! "
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "text": "Visual sensors suggest carnage "
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "text": "level satisfactory."
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "text": "Who is my next victim. "
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "text": "Question mark."
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "text": "Surprised gasp."
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "text": "You are identified as "
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "text": "Travis Touchdown."
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "text": "Luck is an irrational concept. "
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "text": "But your presence "
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "text": "defies probability."
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "text": "Do you remember me."
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "text": "Wha...?"
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "text": "I don't know who or "
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "text": "what the fu..."
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "text": "Wait a second..."
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "text": "Oh yeah!"
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "text": "You're that 5th ranked freak "
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "text": "Henry sliced up before"
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "text": "I got the chance to."
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "text": "Affirmative."
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "text": ""
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "text": "After near fatal decimation,"
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "text": " "
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "text": "I had no choice but to take "
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "text": "this modified form."
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "text": "Looks to me like you "
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "text": "just gained a few pounds."
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "text": "Hardware was affected, "
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "text": "but my pride was not."
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "text": "With determination levels maximum, "
  },
  {
    "id": 36,
    "text": "I thought only of winning."
  },
  {
    "id": 37,
    "text": "It was meaningless. "
  },
  {
    "id": 38,
    "text": "Futile. Illogical."
  },
  {
    "id": 39,
    "text": "But such is the curse of being"
  },
  {
    "id": 40,
    "text": "run by a human brain."
  },
  {
    "id": 41,
    "text": "That brain also makes "
  },
  {
    "id": 42,
    "text": "you talk a lot, doesn't it."
  },
  {
    "id": 43,
    "text": "Henry's the one "
  },
  {
    "id": 44,
    "text": "who tore your shit up. "
  },
  {
    "id": 45,
    "text": "But if you want to take it "
  },
  {
    "id": 46,
    "text": "out on me, go ahead."
  },
  {
    "id": 47,
    "text": "All I desire is a duel with you.  "
  },
  {
    "id": 48,
    "text": "Desire level: One hundred percent."
  },
  {
    "id": 49,
    "text": "Revenge on primary target was "
  },
  {
    "id": 50,
    "text": "previously accomplished. Behold."
  },
  {
    "id": 51,
    "text": "Said dramatically."
  },
  {
    "id": 52,
    "text": "So Henry makes a cameo..."
  },
  {
    "id": 53,
    "text": "Before fighting you,"
  },
  {
    "id": 54,
    "text": "I elected to defeat UAA's formerly "
  },
  {
    "id": 55,
    "text": "topped-ranked assassin"
  },
  {
    "id": 56,
    "text": "as practice sequence."
  },
  {
    "id": 57,
    "text": "This was same individual on whom"
  },
  {
    "id": 58,
    "text": "I also desired vengeance.    "
  },
  {
    "id": 59,
    "text": "Efficient turn of events,  "
  },
  {
    "id": 60,
    "text": "do you agree. Question mark."
  },
  {
    "id": 61,
    "text": "Would you shut up!"
  },
  {
    "id": 62,
    "text": "I just need to "
  },
  {
    "id": 63,
    "text": "make one thing clear."
  },
  {
    "id": 64,
    "text": "I'm not gonna kill you "
  },
  {
    "id": 65,
    "text": "because of Henry."
  },
  {
    "id": 66,
    "text": "I'm gonna kill you cause your "
  },
  {
    "id": 67,
    "text": "big metal ass is in my way."
  },
  {
    "id": 68,
    "text": "Devilish laughter."
  },
  {
    "id": 69,
    "text": "Activating main engine."
  },
  {
    "id": 70,
    "text": "I already know this routine..."
  },
  {
    "id": 71,
    "text": "3"
  },
  {
    "id": 72,
    "text": "2"
  },
  {
    "id": 73,
    "text": "1"
  },
  {
    "id": 74,
    "text": "Fire.  Battle cry."
  },
  {
    "id": 75,
    "text": "Crap!"
  },
  {
    "id": 76,
    "text": "...That was quick!"
  },
  {
    "id": 77,
    "text": "Pretty fast for a tin can!"
  },
  {
    "id": 78,
    "text": "Now it's my turn!"
  }
]